SizeRuleFillScreenTip {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/Designer/SDreamWidgetDesignerViewportToolbar.cpp
    src   "The canvas is the viewport, one design unit per pixel, and follows it as the window resizes. Picking it zooms to 1:1 so that is true straight away. The resolution you chose stays on the asset and comes back with Custom."
