SizeRuleDesiredTip {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/Designer/SDreamWidgetDesignerViewportToolbar.cpp
    src   "Size the canvas to what the root widget's UMG-compatible panel measures, so a tooltip-sized prefab can be authored at its own size. Applied once, when chosen. A root with no such panel measures nothing, and a canvas sized by a scaler rule is not this menu's to set."
    text  "将画布调整为根控件中兼容UMG的面板所测量的大小，以便按自身尺寸制作提示框大小的预制件。仅在选择时应用一次。没有此类面板的根控件不会测量出任何大小，而由缩放规则决定大小的画布不在此菜单的设置范围内。"
    state machine
}

