ScreenSizeTooltip_NoCanvas {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/Designer/SDreamWidgetDesignerViewportToolbar.cpp
    src   "Design screen size: the device resolution to preview.\n\nThis prefab's root carries no DreamCanvas, so nothing scales it and the design canvas simply equals the device resolution. Add a canvas to the root to preview a scale rule."
    text  "设计屏幕尺寸：要预览的设备分辨率。\n\n此预制体的根节点未携带 DreamCanvas，因此没有任何缩放，设计画布直接等于设备分辨率。为根节点添加画布即可预览缩放规则。"
    state machine
}

