SafeZoneTooltip {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/Designer/SDreamWidgetDesignerViewportToolbar.cpp
    src   "Draw the platform's title-safe area on the design canvas. Its own switch, so seeing it no longer means turning the device-resolution overlay on as well. A desktop that declares no safe area draws nothing; r.DebugSafeZone.TitleRatio is what makes one appear."
    text  "在设计画布上绘制平台的标题安全区。它有自己的开关，因此查看它不再需要同时开启设备分辨率叠加层。未声明安全区的桌面平台不会绘制任何内容；r.DebugSafeZone.TitleRatio 可让安全区显示出来。"
    state machine
}

ClipMasksTooltip {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/Designer/SDreamWidgetDesignerViewportToolbar.cpp
    src   "Outline the clip mask of each selected widget that has one: the shape it cuts, a texture or pattern mask's rect, the layer below a widget that clips to it. Needs the designer overlay switched on."
    text  "为每个具有裁剪蒙版的所选控件勾勒其轮廓：它裁出的形状、纹理或图案蒙版的矩形、被控件裁剪到其上的下方层。需要开启设计器叠加层。"
    state machine
}

DesignerChromeTooltip {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/Designer/SDreamWidgetDesignerViewportToolbar.cpp
    src   "Draw everything the editor puts over the prefab: the canvas boundary, selection outlines, handles, guides, layout diagnostics and readouts. Switch it off to see the prefab on its own; the gestures all still work."
    text  "绘制编辑器在预制件上覆盖的所有内容：画布边界、选择轮廓、句柄、引导线、布局诊断和读数。 禁用它以查看预制件本身；所有手势仍然有效。"
    state machine
}

RealtimeViewportTooltip {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/Designer/SDreamWidgetDesignerViewportToolbar.cpp
    src   "Redraw the design viewport on every frame. Off, it redraws when the designer has something new to show -- a gesture, the pointer, a selection, a rebuild -- and otherwise four times a second, so an open designer nobody is touching stops rendering at the editor's frame rate. Animations playing in the preview draw at that slower rate while it is off."
    text  "在每一帧重新绘制设计视图。 禁用后，只有在设计师有新内容要显示时（例如手势、指针、选择或重建），才会重新绘制；否则，每秒重新绘制四次，因此，如果打开的设计师没有被使用，则会以编辑器的帧率为基础进行渲染。 动画在预览中以较慢的速率播放，而当此选项关闭时。"
    state machine
}

PreviewDPITooltip {
    at    Source/DreamGUIEditor/Private/Designer/SDreamWidgetDesignerViewportToolbar.cpp
    src   "Shrink the design canvas by the project's DPI curve, the way UMG's designer does. The curve is the project's own (Project Settings > User Interface), so this previews the application scale Slate will really apply at the chosen device resolution -- and it runs before the DreamCanvas scale rule, which is the order the runtime uses."
    text  "通过项目的 DPI 曲线缩小设计画布，就像 UMG 的设计器所做的那样。 该曲线是项目的自有曲线（项目设置 > 用户界面），因此，这预览了 Slate 将在所选设备分辨率下实际应用的应用程序缩放比例，并且它在 DreamCanvas 缩放规则之前运行，这是运行时使用的顺序。"
    state machine
}

